\ **************************************************************************
\ *
\ *     bss.6502 - the per-frame state (PLAN.md section 2.1)
\ *
\ **************************************************************************
\
\ Zeroed by start. The piece pool (Phase 4); from Phase 5 the visits, the
\ sprite instances, the segment pool, the toggle list.

.bss_start
\ The pool: a page a field, indexed by piece (1..255; 0 is the C's null
\ piece). Pages first, so every one is aligned.
.p_x0   SKIP 256                ; first column
.p_x1   SKIP 256                ; one past the last
.p_y0   SKIP 256                ; the row at x0
.p_glo  SKIP 256                ; the gradient: its fraction...
.p_ghi  SKIP 256                ; ...and its sign (bit 7) and whole rows
.p_ce   SKIP 256                ; the colour's even pattern...
.p_co   SKIP 256                ; ...and odd; both 0: a bound, not plotted
.p_next SKIP 256                ; the next piece in its chain, 0 = the end
